+ *     hardware path, not of our configuration of it.
+ *   - CRTC ENABLE BEFORE PLANE COMMIT. sunxi_drm_atomic_helper_commit_tail()
+ *     (sunxi_drm_drv.c:186-203) hand-rolls exactly the order
+ *     drm_atomic_helper_commit_tail_rpm() provides: disables, then modeset
+ *     enables, then commit_planes, then drm_atomic_helper_fake_vblank().
+ *   - THE SOURCE SWITCH BELONGS INSIDE THE TCON PROGRAM SEQUENCE.
+ *     tcon_tv_src_select(..., LCD_SRC_DE, de_id) sits between the timing
+ *     registers and tcon_tv_open() in sunxi_tcon_edp_mode_init()
+ *     (sunxi_tcon.c:800-810) -- never after the TCON is running. `drm-a733-tcon-tv1-timing-generator-and-video-source`'s
+ *     sun60i_tcon_tv_program() writes TV_SRC_CTL at the same point, and this
