+ *   2. A DATAPATH WRITE HAS A SAFE WINDOW INSIDE THE FRAME. Before arming its
+ *      queue the vendor reads the TCON's current line and, if it is outside
+ *      [vtotal/4, 3*vtotal/4], delays with an hrtimer until it is
+ *      (rcq_update_timer_start(), sunxi_de.c:665-691); the TCON separately
+ *      computes a per-mode deadline from its own start delay
+ *      (sunxi_tcon_calc_judge_line(), sunxi_tcon.c:121-150) and refuses updates
+ *      past it. ⇒ Nothing here has such a guard, so a page flip lands wherever
+ *      it lands. That is named at sun60i_de_kms_scanout() and is stage 3's, and
+ *      it is the shape the fix will take rather than a theory about tearing.
+ *   3. THE PIXEL CLOCK IS THE MODE'S CLOCK DIVIDED BY PIXEL_MODE.
+ *      clk_set_rate(mclk, timings->pixel_clk / pixel_mode) with the same factor
